---
title: "Contact | Lightening Lives"
description: "Contact Lightening Lives about a partnership, tests, awareness and counselling programmes, or an institutional order. Hyderabad, India."
label: Contact
h1: Tell us what your programme needs
lead: "Choose where you would like to begin. We work with institutions, and each request is discussed on its own terms."
notice: true
closing: false
---
{#- Contact (content file 5.15). The layout opens the page (label, h1, lead) and, with closing: false,
    ends it with the notice for individuals (4.4) in a band of its own: a closing band asking the
    reader to contact the company, with a button to this page, would repeat the page itself.
    The four contact actions are the home page's (src/site/_data/actions.json), here with the line
    under each; each is an email with its subject filled in, without script (Review Focus 5).
    contact.js adds the condition a test's page sends (?condition=) to each email's body: it finds the
    actions by data-contact. "Write to us", the form, waits for Phase 7 (the plan's decision "Email
    links at launch"). The addresses are site.json's, as the footer's; "Open in maps" opens Google
    Maps' search for the address in the same tab, as every link on the site does (on a phone the
    maps app takes it), with rel="noopener" as the site's other links out carry. The bands: the actions
    continue the opening's mist; the addresses are a paper band; the notice's band is mist again. -#}
{%- from "actions.njk" import actionList with context %}
{%- set arrow = '<svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="12" viewBox="0 0 18 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M1 6h15M11 1l5 5-5 5"/></svg>' %}

  <!-- Where to begin: the four actions, each with its line; beside them, writing or calling directly -->
  <section id="where-to-begin" class="section contact-begin" aria-labelledby="where-to-begin-h write-or-call-h" data-contact>
    <div class="wrap grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <h2 id="where-to-begin-h" class="label">Where to begin</h2>
        {{ actionList("mt-4", { lines: true }) }}
      </div>
      <div id="write-or-call" class="lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9">
        <h2 id="write-or-call-h" class="label">Write or call</h2>
        <ul class="reach mt-4">
          <li><a class="link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
          <li><a class="link" href="tel:{{ site.tel }}">{{ site.phone | replace(" ", "&nbsp;") | safe }}</a>{% if site.whatsapp %} <span class="text-moss">(call or WhatsApp)</span>{% endif %}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Where we are: the two offices, each with a link to the map -->
  <section id="where-we-are" class="section bg-paper" aria-labelledby="where-we-are-h">
    <div class="wrap grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <h2 id="where-we-are-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-5">Where we are</h2>
      <ul class="addresses lg:col-span-7">
        {%- for key, a in site.addresses %}
        {%- set full = a.street + ", " + a.locality + ", " + a.region + " " + a.postcode %}
        <li>
          <h3 class="h3">{{ a.label }}</h3>
          <address>{{ full }}</address>
          <a class="link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query={{ full | urlencode }}" rel="noopener">Open in maps<span class="sr-only">: {{ a.label }}</span>
            {{ arrow | safe }}
          </a>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
